{
  "_doc": "The queue of label and filter changes waiting for Gmail (shared/src/account-queue.ts, Android :core mail/AccountQueue.kt). Changes are named by `seq`. A label or filter made on the device has an id starting `local:` until Gmail makes it. enqueue: enqueueAccount over `add` in turn. next: nextAccountChange's seq, or null. join: joinAccountQueues(stored, early). resolve: resolveLocalId. without: withoutLocalId. labelMade / filterMade(queue, seq, gmailId): Gmail made what the change made. refused: changeRefused(queue, seq). relabel: relabelChanges over thread changes; `same` lists entries returned unchanged as the same objects. sendable: the seqs sendableChanges keeps. labels: labelsWithPending. filters: filtersWithPending. unsynced: unsyncedChanges(threadChanges, queue).",
  "localId": [
    {
      "id": "local:label",
      "expect": true
    },
    {
      "id": "Label_12",
      "expect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "INBOX",
      "expect": false
    }
  ],
